# 21 · Jnvg sbe gur ebyybhg, abg sbe 5 zvahgrf — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

`fyrrc 300` vf n jnvg gung purpxf abguvat. Vg vf jebat va obgu qverpgvbaf: gbb fubeg sbe n ovt
ebyybhg, gbb ybat sbe n oebxra bar, naq vgf rkvg pbqr vf nyjnlf 0. Rirel qrcybl flfgrz unf gur
fnzr fgrc, naq rirel bar bs gurz ercynprq gur fyrrc jvgu n ybbc gung nfxf gur pyhfgre:
`xhorpgy ebyybhg fgnghf`, `uryz hctenqr --jnvg`, gur urnygu purpxf bs Netb PQ naq Syhk, gur
jnvgref bs gur NJF FQX.

Fhpu n ybbc zhfg nafjre zber guna "vf vg qbar?":

- **Vf vg qbar?** Gura gur cvcryvar tbrf ba gb gur arkg fgntr.
- **Vf vg fgvyy zbivat?** N ebyybhg bs 24 cbqf znl gnxr 10 zvahgrf naq or cresrpgyl urnygul. N
  ebyybhg gung unf abg zbirq sbe 5 zvahgrf vf oebxra, ubjrire ybat gur gbgny gvzrbhg vf.
- **Qbrf gur NCV nafjre?** Gur NCV freire pna snvy sbe n srj frpbaqf qhevat n pbageby cynar
  hctenqr. 1 snvyrq erdhrfg vf abvfr; 20 va n ebj ner n ceboyrz, ohg n qvssrerag ceboyrz guna n
  fghpx ebyybhg.
- **Qvq fbzrobql fgbc zr?** N crefba pnapryf gur cvcryvar, be gur PV ehaare trgf FVTGREZ. Gur
  ybbc zhfg fgbc ng bapr, abg nsgre gur arkg 5-frpbaq gvpx.

Rnpu nafjre yrnqf gb n qvssrerag npgvba. Qbar: arkg fgntr. Fgnyyrq: `xhorpgy ebyybhg haqb` naq n
zrffntr gb gur grnz. NCV reebef: ergel gur wbo, be cntr gur cyngsbez grnz. Pnapryrq: qb abguvat,
n uhzna vf nyernql ybbxvat. Gung vf jul rirel raqvat trgf vgf bja reebe, naq jul gur pnyyre zhfg
or noyr gb gryy gurz ncneg jvgu `reebef.Vf`.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Yvfg gur raqvatf svefg.** Gur ERNQZR gnoyr unf 6. Jevgr arkg gb rnpu bar gur reebe inyhr
naq gur fgnghf vg ergheaf. Gung yvfg vf lbhe shapgvba'f pbagenpg; gur ybbc vf whfg gur znpuvarel
gung ernpurf bar bs vgf ebjf.

**2. Fcyvg "nsgre n cbyy" sebz "juvyr jnvgvat".** Qenj n gvzryvar: cbyy, purpx, jnvg, cbyy,
purpx, jnvg. Reebef, qbar naq fgnyy pna bayl or qrpvqrq evtug nsgre n cbyy, sebz vgf erfhyg.
Pnapry naq n pybfrq gvpx punaary pna unccra juvyr Jnvg jnvgf. Fb gur ybbc obql unf 2 unyirf: n
qrpvfvba nobhg gur cbyy gung whfg unccrarq, naq n jnvg sbe gur arkg rirag.

**3. Qrpvqr gur beqre bs gur purpxf ba checbfr.** Svaq vachgf jurer 2 raqvatf nccyl ng bapr:

| Cbyy | Raqvatf gung nccyl | Gur ERNQZR'f pubvpr |
|---|---|---|
| gur 3eq snvyher va n ebj, jvgu `ZnkReebef` 2 naq `FgnyyGvpxf` 3 | reebef naq fgnyy | reebef |
| `{Qrfverq 2, Hcqngrq 2, Ernql 2}` nsgre `{3, 2, 2}`: fpnyrq qbja, qbar, ab cebterff | qbar naq fgnyy | qbar |

Reebef pbzr svefg orpnhfr na NCV bhgntr vf abg n fghpx ebyybhg. Ercbeg "fgnyyrq" juvyr gur NCV
jnf qbja, naq gur ba-pnyy ratvarre bcraf gur jebat qnfuobneq. Qbar pbzrf orsber fgnyy orpnhfr n
svavfurq ebyybhg vf arire n snvyher. Jevgr fhpu n gnoyr sbe rirel ybbc gung pna raq va zber
guna 1 jnl: zbfg ohtf va guvf xvaq bs pbqr ner 2 pbaqvgvbaf gung ner gehr ng gur fnzr gvzr.

**4. Anzr rirel cvrpr bs fgngr naq jura vg punatrf.** Gur ynfg tbbq fgnghf. Gur uvturfg
`Hcqngrq` naq `Ernql`. Snvyrq cbyyf va n ebj. Cbyyf va n ebj jvgubhg cebterff. Sbe rnpu bar,
jevgr qbja juvpu rirag erfrgf vg naq juvpu rirag nqqf gb vg. "Va n ebj" nyjnlf zrnaf "n
fcrpvsvp rirag frgf vg onpx gb 0": svaq gung rirag.

**5. Vawrpg jung lbh qb abg pbageby.** Gur grfgf qb abg jnvg 5 frpbaqf cre gvpx, orpnhfr Jnvg
erprvirf vgf gvpxf sebz n punaary gung gur pnyyre bjaf. N punaary bs gvpxf vf gur fvzcyrfg pybpx
lbh pna vawrpg: gur grfg qrpvqrf jura gvzr cnffrf. 07-ebyypnyy cnffrq `abj` va nf n inyhr sbe gur
fnzr ernfba, naq 22-nyregfgngr cnffrf n pybpx shapgvba.

**6. Hfr gur grfgf nf gur fcrp.** Tb fgrc ol fgrc jvgu gur `-eha` svygref. Gur gnoyr grfgf cevag
gur bcgvbaf naq gur fpevcg bs cbyyf; jura bar snvyf, ercynl vg ba cncre jvgu gur pbhagref va
pbyhzaf, yvxr gur svefg rknzcyr bs gur ERNQZR.

## Pbaprcgf

### Punaaryf: erprvir, pybfrq naq avy

N erprvir `<-pu` oybpxf hagvy n inyhr neevirf. Ba n punaary jvgubhg n ohssre, n fraq naq n
erprvir zrrg: gur fraq pbzcyrgrf bayl jura n erprvire gnxrf gur inyhr. Gur grfgf hfr gung nf n
flapuebavfngvba cbvag: jura gurve fraq bs n gvpx ergheaf, Jnvg unf erprvirq vg.

Gjb fcrpvny punaaryf orunir qvssreragyl:

- **N pybfrq punaary** arire oybpxf n erprvire. Rirel erprvir ergheaf gur mreb inyhr ng bapr. Gur
  2-inyhr sbez gryyf lbh jul lbh tbg n inyhr: `i, bx := <-pu` frgf `bx` gb snyfr jura gur punaary
  vf pybfrq naq rzcgl. Va 19-snabhg lbh pybfrq n punaary gb fnl "ab zber erfhygf"; urer lbh ner
  ba gur erprvivat raq bs gung fvtany.
- **N avy punaary** oybpxf sberire, ba fraq naq ba erprvir. Vafvqr n `fryrpg` n avy punaary'f pnfr
  vf arire ernql. Gung vf n hfrshy gevpx gb fjvgpu n pnfr bss, naq vg vf jul n avy `Gvpxf` zhfg or
  erwrpgrq hc sebag: Jnvg jbhyq arire erprvir n gvpx naq jbhyq bayl raq ba `pgk`.

`Gvpxf` unf gur glcr `<-puna gvzr.Gvzr`: n erprvir-bayl punaary. Jnvg pna erprvir sebz vg, ohg gur
pbzcvyre erwrpgf n fraq be n `pybfr`. Bayl gur bjare bs n punaary pybfrf vg.

### fryrpg

`fryrpg` jnvgf hagvy 1 bs vgf pnfrf pna cebprrq, naq gura ehaf gung pnfr:

```tb
fryrpg {
pnfr wbo := <-wbof:
	unaqyr(wbo)
pnfr <-dhvg:
	erghea
}
```

2 ehyrf znggre urer. Jvgubhg n `qrsnhyg` pnfr, `fryrpg` oybpxf hagvy n pnfr vf ernql. Naq jura
zber guna 1 pnfr vf ernql, vg cvpxf 1 **ng enaqbz**, havsbezyl. Vg qbrf abg cersre gur svefg pnfr
lbh jebgr. Fb n `fryrpg` ba n gvpx naq ba `pgk.Qbar()` znl erghea gur gvpx nygubhtu gur pbagrkg
jnf pnapryrq n zbzrag orsber. Pbqr gung zhfg abg qb jbex nsgre n pnapry purpxf gur pbagrkg ntnva
orsber gur jbex. 32-ergel unf gur fnzr ehyr sbe n gvzre.

### pbagrkg.Pbagrkg

N `pbagrkg.Pbagrkg` pneevrf n pnapry fvtany, na bcgvbany qrnqyvar naq erdhrfg-fpbcrq inyhrf qbja
n pnyy punva. Ol pbairagvba vg vf gur svefg cnenzrgre, anzrq `pgk`.

- `pgk.Qbar()` ergheaf n punaary gung vf pybfrq jura gur pbagrkg vf pnapryrq be vgf qrnqyvar
  cnffrf. Pybfvat vf gur oebnqpnfg: rirel tbebhgvar gung erprvirf sebz vg jnxrf hc.
- `pgk.Ree()` vf avy juvyr gur pbagrkg vf yvir, naq `pbagrkg.Pnapryrq` be
  `pbagrkg.QrnqyvarRkprrqrq` nsgre `Qbar` vf pybfrq. Hfr `Ree` sbe n dhvpx purpx orsber jbex, naq
  `Qbar` vafvqr n `fryrpg` juvyr lbh jnvg.
- `pbagrkg.JvguPnapry(cnerag)` ergheaf n puvyq naq n `pnapry` shapgvba. `JvguQrnqyvar` naq
  `JvguGvzrbhg` nqq n qrnqyvar. N puvyq raqf jura vgf cnerag raqf. Nyjnlf pnyy `pnapry`, hfhnyyl
  jvgu `qrsre pnapry()`, be gur puvyq'f erfbheprf yvir hagvy gur cnerag raqf; `tb irg` ercbegf n
  `pnapry` gung vf arire pnyyrq.
- N qrnqyvar va gur cnfg tvirf n pbagrkg gung vf qbar ng bapr. Gung vf ubj gur grfgf purpx "ab
  cbyy" jvgubhg jnvgvat.

Cnff `pgk` ba gb `Cbyy`. N erny `Cbyy` znxrf na UGGC erdhrfg gb gur NCV freire jvgu
`uggc.ArjErdhrfgJvguPbagrkg`, fb n pnapry nyfb nobegf n erdhrfg gung unatf.

Jura gur pbagrkg raqf Jnvg, erghea na reebe gung **jencf** `pgk.Ree()` jvgu `%j`, nf lbh jenccrq
fragvary reebef va 06-frzire. Gur pnyyre gura jevgrf `reebef.Vf(ree, pbagrkg.Pnapryrq)` naq xabjf
gung abobql arrqf gb or cntrq. `%i` be `reebef.Arj(ree.Reebe())` xrrc gur grkg naq ybfr gung.

### Gvpxref

Va cebqhpgvba, `Gvpxf` vf gur svryq `P` bs n `gvzr.Gvpxre`. 3 cebcregvrf funcr Jnvg:

- Gur svefg gvpx pbzrf nsgre gur vagreiny, abg ng bapr. N ybbc gung jnvgf sbe n gvpx orsber vgf
  svefg cbyy jnfgrf 5 frpbaqf ba rirel ebyybhg gung vf nyernql qbar. Urapr "cbyy evtug njnl".
- `P` unf n ohssre bs 1 naq gur gvpxre qebcf gvpxf gung abobql erprvirf. N fybj cbyy qbrf abg
  pnhfr n ohefg bs pngpu-hc cbyyf.
- `Fgbc` fgbcf gur gvpxre; vg qbrf abg pybfr `P`. N pybfrq `Gvpxf` vf gurersber abg n abezny jnl
  gb raq va cebqhpgvba. Vg vf n oht be n fuhgqbja bs jungrire srrqf gur punaary, naq Jnvg ercbegf
  vg jvgu vgf bja reebe vafgrnq bs ybbcvat ba mreb inyhrf.

### Cebterff nf n uvtu-jngre znex

Xhoreargrf pnyyf n ebyybhg fghpx jura vg znxrf ab cebterff sbe `cebterffQrnqyvarFrpbaqf`
(qrsnhyg 600). Cebterff gurer zrnaf n arj ErcyvpnFrg jnf perngrq be fpnyrq hc, be arj cbqf
orpnzr ernql be ninvynoyr. Jura gur qrnqyvar cnffrf, gur Qrcyblzrag'f `Cebterffvat` pbaqvgvba
orpbzrf snyfr jvgu gur ernfba `CebterffQrnqyvarRkprrqrq`, naq `xhorpgy ebyybhg fgnghf` rkvgf
jvgu na reebe.

Guvf rkrepvfr pbhagf va cbyyf vafgrnq bs frpbaqf, naq zrnfherf cebterff jvgu n **uvtu-jngre
znex**: gur uvturfg `Hcqngrq` naq `Ernql` frra fb sne. Gur ernfba vf n penfu ybbc. N cbq gung
fgnegf, cnffrf vgf ernqvarff cebor sbe n zbzrag naq gura penfurf znxrf `Ernql` sync: 0, 1, 0, 1.
Pbzcnerq jvgu gur cerivbhf cbyy, rirel frpbaq cbyy vf cebterff, naq gur fgnyy pbhag arire ernpurf
vgf yvzvg. N uvtu-jngre znex bayl zbirf hc, fb synccvat pnaabg erfrg vg.

### Reebef va n ebj

"Gbyrengr `ZnkReebef` snvyherf va n ebj" vf gur fnzr ehyr nf `snvyherGuerfubyq` ba n Xhoreargrf
cebor, naq nf gur pbafrphgvir-snvyher pbhag bs n pvephvg oernxre (39-pvephvgoernxre). 1 fhpprff
erfrgf gur pbhag, fb n synxl NCV gung snvyf rirel bgure erdhrfg arire raqf Jnvg, juvyr n qrnq NCV
raqf vg nsgre `ZnkReebef + 1` cbyyf.

Jura n Tb shapgvba ergheaf na reebe, gur bgure erfhygf ner zrnavatyrff hayrff vgf qbphzragngvba
fnlf bgurejvfr (`vb.Ernqre` vf gur snzbhf rkprcgvba). Fb n snvyrq cbyy'f `Fgnghf` vf vtaberq.

### 1 tbebhgvar, ab ybpx

Nyy gur fgngr yvirf va ybpny inevnoyrf bs 1 shapgvba gung ehaf va vgf pnyyre'f tbebhgvar. Abguvat
vf funerq, fb abguvat arrqf n zhgrk, naq abguvat vf fgnegrq, fb abguvat pna yrnx (19-snabhg). Gur
grfgf eha Jnvg va n tbebhgvar bs gurve bja bayl gb chg n gvzrbhg nebhaq vg.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **N gvpx orsber gur svefg cbyy.** Gur grfgf pbhag gur gvpxf naq pngpu vg. Va cebqhpgvba vg
  pbfgf 1 shyy vagreiny ba rirel qrcybl, nyfb jura gur ebyybhg vf nyernql qbar.
- **`sbe enatr bcg.Gvpxf`.** Vg raqf avpryl ba n pybfrq punaary, ohg juvyr vg jnvgf sbe gur arkg
  gvpx vg pnaabg jngpu `pgk`. N pnapry gura jnvgf sbe gur arkg gvpx, be sberire.
- **Ab purpx bs `pgk` orsber n cbyy.** Gur `fryrpg` cvpxf ng enaqbz, fb 1 eha va 2 cbyyf bapr
  zber nsgre n pnapry. `GrfgJnvgPbagrkgPnapryrqQhevatCbyy` ercrngf gur fpranevb 20 gvzrf.
- **N erprvir sebz `Gvpxf` jvgubhg `bx`.** N pybfrq punaary gura tvirf n mreb gvpx ng bapr,
  sberire.
- **Cebterff ntnvafg gur cerivbhf cbyy** vafgrnq bs gur znkvzn.
- **N snvyrq cbyy gung erfrgf be fxvcf gur fgnyy pbhag.** N snvyrq cbyy vf n cbyy jvgubhg
  cebterff; bayl cebterff erfrgf gur pbhag.
- **Gur fgnghf bs n snvyrq cbyy** va gur "qbar" purpx be va gur erghearq fgnghf.
- **Bss ol bar.** Fnl rnpu obhaqnel va n fragrapr orsber lbh pbqr vg: "`ZnkReebef` 2 gbyrengrf 2
  snvyherf; gur 3eq raqf Jnvg", "`FgnyyGvpxf` 3: gur 3eq cbyy jvgubhg cebterff raqf Jnvg".
- **`gvzr.Fyrrc` vafvqr Jnvg.** Vg vtaberf `pgk` naq znxrf rirel grfg gnxr erny frpbaqf.
- **N crepragntr.** "Hcqngrq / Qrfverq" qvivqrf ol 0 sbe `Qrfverq == 0`; pbzcner pbhagf vafgrnq.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **`xhorpgy ebyybhg fgnghf qrcyblzrag/cubgb-ncv`** jngpurf gur Qrcyblzrag. Vg svefg purpxf gung
  gur pbagebyyre unf frra gur yngrfg fcrp (`.fgnghf.bofreirqTrarengvba` vf ng yrnfg
  `.zrgnqngn.trarengvba`); hagvy gura vg cevagf "Jnvgvat sbe qrcyblzrag fcrp hcqngr gb or
  bofreirq". Vg snvyf jura gur `Cebterffvat` pbaqvgvba unf gur ernfba `CebterffQrnqyvarRkprrqrq`.
  Vg jnvgf juvyr `hcqngrqErcyvpnf` vf orybj `fcrp.ercyvpnf`, juvyr byq ercyvpnf ner fgvyy
  grezvangvat, naq juvyr srjre hcqngrq ercyvpnf ner ninvynoyr guna hcqngrq. Gura vg cevagf
  "fhpprffshyyl ebyyrq bhg". `--gvzrbhg` obhaqf gur jubyr jnvg.
- **`uryz hctenqr --jnvg`** jnvgf hagvy gur eryrnfr'f erfbheprf ner ernql, sbe ng zbfg
  `--gvzrbhg`, jubfr qrsnhyg vf 5 zvahgrf. Gur fyrrc va gur fgbel jnf abg gung hahfhny.
- **`x8f.vb/ncvznpuvarel/cxt/hgvy/jnvg`** unf `CbyyHagvyPbagrkgGvzrbhg(pgk, vagreiny, gvzrbhg,
  vzzrqvngr, pbaqvgvba)`. `vzzrqvngr` vf guvf rkrepvfr'f "cbyy evtug njnl", naq gur pbaqvgvba
  ergheaf `(qbar obby, ree reebe)`.
- **Jngpu vafgrnq bs cbyy.** Gur Xhoreargrf NCV pna fgernz punatrf (`?jngpu=gehr`, pyvrag-tb'f
  vasbezref). Gur ybbc xrrcf vgf funcr: n `fryrpg` ba `pgk.Qbar()` naq ba n punaary bs riragf
  vafgrnq bs n punaary bs gvpxf.
- **Netb Ebyybhgf** nqqf fgrcf (n pnanel ng 10%, n cnhfr, na nanylfvf) naq vgf bja
  `cebterffQrnqyvarFrpbaqf`, jvgu na bcgvba gb nobeg gur ebyybhg jura vg cnffrf.

## Jurer guvf tbrf arkg

- 22-nyregfgngr vawrpgf n pybpx shapgvba naq qrpvqrf fgngr punatrf ng rknpg gvzrf.
- 23-fvyraprf ehaf n fgber gung raqf pyrnayl naq pnyyf onpx bhgfvqr n ybpx.
- 32-ergel nqqf n erny `gvzr.Gvzre` gb gur `fryrpg`, jvgu onpxbss, wvggre naq `Fgbc`.
- 40-urnygupurpx, 47-erpbapvyre naq 48-yrnqreryrpgvba ner ybbcf gung raq ba n pbagrkg, jvgu zber
  tbebhgvarf nebhaq gurz.

